<title>USA: Compass extends offer for DAKA.</title>
<headline>Compass extends offer for DAKA.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compass Group Plc said Tuesday its unit Compass Holdings Inc extended its offer to buy all shares of DAKA International Inc for $7.50 a share in cash until 1700 EDT/2100 GMT on Tuesday, July 15.</p>
<p>The company said it had received 10.6 million shares, or about 95 percent of DAKA's outstanding shares, by July 14.  </p>
<p>A Compass spokesman said it &quot;was likely&quot; Compass closes the deal on Thursday.&quot;</p>
